Flux linked with each turn of the solenoid is, $\phi=2.8 \times 10^{-3} \mathrm{ Wb}\therefore \quad$ Total magnetic flux of the solenoid is,
$\begin{aligned}
& \phi_{\mathrm{net}}=\mathrm{N} \phi \\
& \phi_{\mathrm{net}}=1500 \times 2.8 \times 10^{-3}=4.2 \mathrm{ Wb}
\end{aligned}$
Flux can also be given by, $\phi=\mathrm{LI}\therefore \quad$ The self-inductance of the solenoid is,
$\begin{aligned}
